# Access integration tests

Policy permission coverage (can, cannot, tenant 404, signed-out redirect, sees vs does not see because of membership) lives in `test/integration/{resource}_access_integration_test.rb`. Display and flow stay in the resource integration file.

```ruby
# bad
# test/integration/customers_test.rb
class CustomersTest < ActionDispatch::IntegrationTest
  test "alex on northwind cannot show a globex customer" do
    get customer_path(customers(:acme_inc))
    assert_response :not_found
  end
end
```

```ruby
# good
# test/integration/customer_access_integration_test.rb
class CustomerAccessIntegrationTest < ActionDispatch::IntegrationTest
  test "alex on northwind cannot show a globex customer" do
    get customer_path(customers(:acme_inc))
    assert_response :not_found
  end
end
```

Do not put currency or copied page text that is not a permission check in an access file. Model `in_org` tests stay in `test/models/`. Do not add empty access files for resources with no HTTP permission tests yet.
